// The new target's random room position: split out of add_one_target (and
// split again per axis) because the two pushes each need their own random
// draw, which already fills a 3-action budget on its own.

add_target_position() {
  add_target_axis((import grid_width), (import target_columns));
  add_target_axis((import grid_height), (import target_rows));
} return void;
